ibility\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope this can ease the game experience for people who deal with this type of colorblindness and enjoy the game like everyone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♡ Have fun in Tiny Lands 2! ♡</p>", "short_description": "Take your perception into a new dimension with the relaxing sense of photorealistic miniature scenes in Tiny Lands 2. Find the differences and stories by exploring handcrafted 3D dioramas. Can you find them all?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Catalan, Dutch, Thai, Filipino, Malay, Indonesian", "reviews": "“Toca volver a detenernos y mirar con tranquilidad”<br>8 – Generación Pixel<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/243228742f32cbe69e6425cd7398bf08965d7191/header.jpg?t=1783668265", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/74d1b57bf5de03218ba53e846189990df6e147a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783668265", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2213330/74d1b57bf5de03218ba53e846189990df6e147a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783668265", "website": "https://store.steampowered.com/developer/hyperthreestudio", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</st